invalid type: string "The map phi sends a di-sk tree T in tilde-DT_11^(1,0) to phi(T) in tilde-DT_11^(0,1). For the example, eta^{-1}(T) = pi = 5 2 3 4 1 9 11 10 6 8 7 and eta^{-1}(phi(T)) = pi' = 5 9 6 8 7 11 10 2 3 4 1. The statistics (DESB, LMAX, LMIN) have value ({1,2,6,7,10}, {5,9,11}, {5,2,1}) for both pi and pi'. The statistic pair (comp, iar) has value (2,1) for pi and (1,2) for pi'.ÿÿÿÿÿÿ